window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The circus has come to Collinwood. </p><p>Tad Collins, a man haunted by an unhappy childhood, is rich, arrogant and so terribly lonely. Marie Olson, the tattooed lady, is haunted by a past that she has tried to escape. Naturally they hate each other. But when a mysterious and sinister clown breaks into Collinwood to steal a book on the occult, Tad and Marie have to work together. </p><p>They don't realise, though, that the clown has plans for them both.... </p><p>Directed by Scott Handcock. </p>"; 
